data equinix_ny7_density: CabinetDensityClaim = DensityUnread {
  obligation: "The operator's own NY7 page, www.equinix.com/data-centers/americas-colocation/united-states-colocation/new-york-data-centers/ny7, fetched 2026-09-09 with a full browser user-agent (HTTP 200) and read from RAW HTML against a SUBJECT control (NY7 occurs 13 times), emits a spec-table row labelled exactly \"Minimum Cabinet Density\" with the value \"4kVA\". That is a commitment FLOOR in apparent power, not a maximum and not real power; the annotation above this block states once why neither existing figure arm may hold it. RESOLVE by asking the quote for the per-cabinet air-cooled MAXIMUM at NY7 (5851 Westside Ave, North Bergen)."
